  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 904.04 Density. Maple syrup shall have a density ranging from 36 to 37 degrees Baume or 66.9 to 68.9 degrees Brix at 60 degrees Fahrenheit.\n\nSource. #2656, eff 3-23-84, EXPIRED 3-23-90\n\nNew. #4956, eff 10-19-90; EXPIRED 10-19-96\n\nNew. #6453, eff 2-15-97, EXPIRED: 2-15-05\n\nNew. #10744, eff 12-16-14; ss by #14225, eff 3-29-25",
